---
description: >-
  `autonumber both` gives the sender and the receiver of a message their own
  number in both directions, and a message to self a single number.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber both
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  Alice->>Bob: Sender gets 1, receiver gets 2
  Bob->>Bob: A message to self gets 3
  Bob-->>Alice: Right to left gets 4 and 5
  Alice->>Bob: Next message continues at 6
